 is NOT Claritin, Sinopril is NOT Sinupret, Depozine is NOT Diosmin, Controloc/كونترولوك is NOT Protiloc/بروتولوك, Eucarbon/اوكاربون is NOT Neocarbon/نيوكاربون, Zithron/زيثرون is NOT Zithromax/زيثروماكس, Carntina/كارنتينا is NOT Carnivita/كارنيفيتا).\r\n23:    - If the trade brand is a different commercial brand or generic substitute, YOU MUST RETURN \"status\": \"no_match\" (or omit it).\r\n24:    - Allow common Arabic OCR scanning artifacts, dropped letters/syllables, phonetic variants, and Arabic/Persian letter substitutions of the SAME exact commercial brand (e.g. فيوسيدين/فيوسيدل where connected 'ين' is read as 'ل', ميبو/ميو where 'ب' is dropped, بروفين/برونفين, امبوفير/اميفير, ديباكين/ديبيكان, or dropped initial 'ا', dropped single letters or missing dots like 'ن' or 'ب', Persian/Urdu letters like پ for ب or ک for ك or گ for ك/ج, visually confused OCR letters like 'ف' vs 'د', or slight vowel variations).\r\n25: \r\n26: 2. STRENGTH IS A RED LINE (ZERO TOLERANCE):\r\n27:    - If BOTH sides explicitly specify DIFFERENT, CONFLICTING numeric strengths (e.g. requested 500mg vs candidate specifies 1000mg or 250mg, or 300mg vs 100mg, or 40mg vs 20mg):\r\n28:      YOU MUST RETURN \"status\": \"no_match\". A different concentration cannot be dispensed without doctor approval.\r\n29:    - MISSING STRENGTH IN WAREHOUSE: If the requested shortage specifies a strength, but the warehouse lists the SAME drug without specifying strength: THIS IS A MATCH (\"status\": \"match\")!\r\n30:    - Note vernacular and fractional equivalencies:\r\n31:      - 1000mg = 1gm (1000مجم = 1جم).\r\n32:      - 500mg = 0.5gm = نص (نصف).\r\n33:      - 0.25mg = 250mcg = 25. مجم = ربع.\r\n34: \r\n35: 3. DOSAGE FORM (SAME DRUG BUT DIFFERENT FORM -> \"review\"):\r\n36:    - If the candidate is the EXACT SAME commercial drug with the SAME strength, but has a DIFFERENT dosage form (e.g. requested Cream and warehouse has Ointment, or requested Drops and warehouse has Tablets/Ampoules, or requested Tablets and warehouse has Injections):\r\n37:      RETURN \"status\": \"review\" with Arabic reason (e.g. \"نفس الدواء والتركيز ولكن الهيئة مختلفة: مطلوب كريم والمخزن عنده مرهم\").\r\n38:    - If dosage forms are identical or compatible (tablets vs capsules, or cream vs cream) -> RETURN \"status\": \"match\".\r\n39: \r\n40: 4. PACKAGING, PACK SIZE & QUANTITY (DOES NOT MATTER -> MATCH!):\r\n41:    - Different tablet counts (20 vs 30 vs 60 tablets), strip counts (2 strips vs 3 strips), ampoule counts (3 vs 6 ampoules), wholesale packaging lot sizes (باكت, باكو, كرتونة, 32ب), and commercial price indicators (\"س ج\", \"سعر جديد\") DO NOT prevent a match. As long as brand and strength match, THIS IS A 100% MATCH (\"status\": \"match\").\r\n42: \r\n43: SCHEMA:\r\n44: Return ONLY a valid JSON object matching this schema:\r\n45: {\r\n46:   \"results\": [\r\n47:     {\r\n48:       \"case_id\": \"string\",\r\n49:       \"status\": \"match\" | \"review\" | \"no_match\",\r\n50:       \"item_id\": \"string (the matching candidate ID, or empty string if no_match)\",\r\n51:       \"reason\": \"string (Arabic explanation for review/no_match, empty string for match)\"\r\n52:     }\r\n53:   ]\r\n54: }\r\n55: \r\n56: CRITICAL RULES FOR RESPONSE:\r\n57: - MANDATORY: You MUST return a result item for EVERY SINGLE input case_id. If the input contains N cases, \"results\" MUST contain exactly N items.\r\n58: - NEVER omit any case_id under any circumstances!\r\n59: - For each case_id:\r\n60:   * \"status\": \"match\" (if there is a valid match, specify candidate item_id, empty reason)\r\n61:   * \"status\": \"review\" (if same drug & strength but different dosage form, specify candidate item_id and Arabic reason)\r\n62:   * \"status\": \"no_match\" (if strength conflict, generic alternative, different brand, or no valid match; item_id is \"\", with Arabic reason)\r\n63: - DO NOT return markdown blocks (no ```json). Return ONLY the raw JSON starting with { and ending with }.\r\n64: \"\"\"\r\n65: \r\n66: def norm_num(s: str) -> str:\r\n67:     s = str(s)\r\n68:     for e, w in zip('٠١٢٣٤٥٦٧٨٩', '0123456789'):\r\n69:         s = s.replace(e, w)\r\n70:     return s\r\n71: \r\n72: def get_strength_pattern(text: str) -> str | None:\r\n73:     text = norm_num(text.lower())\r\n74:     m = re.search(r'(\\d+(?:\\.\\d+)?)\\s*(مجم|مج|جم|جرام|gm|mg|mcg|مكجم)', text)\r\n75:     if m:\r\n76:         val = m.group(1)\r\n77:         unit = m.group(2)\r\n78:         if unit in ['جم', 'جرام', 'gm']:\r\n79:             # Pharmacological rule: tablets/capsules/pills never come in multi-gram dosages (>=5g).\r\n80:             # In Egyptian warehouse price lists, '10 جم اقراص' is a common shorthand for 10 mg (not 10,000 mg!).\r\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n"}
