{"step_index":9320,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-25T11:37:59Z","thinking":"Analyzing the comparison data for these four runs, the goal is to identify which performs best in terms of matching items and minimizing items needing review or were not found. PROC-015 shows the highest number of matched items. However, PROC-016 has a large number needing review, indicating potential issues in its matching quality.\n\n\nFocus shifts to cross-comparison of the Excel data across all procedures. Initial step involves extracting and organizing matched, reviewed, and not-found items from each sheet. Identifying discrepancies between Gemini and ChatGPT's matches necessitates detailed inspection of brand identity, strength, combination, and dosage form accuracy for all matched items.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Forensic 4-way comparative analysis script for PROC-012, 014, 015, 016","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"import openpyxl\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport json\nimport re\nfrom rapidfuzz import fuzz\n\nPROCESSES = {\n    \"PROC-012\": Path(r\"D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy\\data\\processes\\PROC-012\\results_PROC-012.xlsx\"),\n    \"PROC-014\": Path(r\"D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy\\data\\processes\\PROC-014\\results_PROC-014.xlsx\"),\n    \"PROC-015\": Path(r\"D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy\\data\\processes\\PROC-015\\results_PROC-015.xlsx\"),\n    \"PROC-016\": Path(r\"D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy\\data\\processes\\PROC-016\\results_PROC-016.xlsx\"),\n}\n\ndef load_process_excel(proc_id, file_path):\n    wb = openpyxl.load_workbook(file_path, data_only=True)\n    data = {\n        \"id\": proc_id,\n        \"sheets\": wb.sheetnames,\n        \"matches\": [],\n        \"reviews\": [],\n        \"not_found\": [],\n        \"matches_by_wh\": {},\n    }\n    \n    # 1. Matches sheet (المطابقة)\n    match_sheet_name = None\n    for name in wb.sheetnames:\n        if \"مطابقة\" in name or \"المطابقة\" in name:\n            match_sheet_name = name\n            break\n            \n    if match_sheet_name:\n        ws = wb[match_sheet_name]\n        headers = [str(cell.value or '').strip() for cell in ws[1]]\n        for row in ws.iter_rows(min_row=2, values_only=True):\n            if not any(row):\n                continue\n            row_dict = {headers[i] if i < len(headers) else f\"col_{i}\": row[i] for i in range(len(row))}\n            data[\"matches\"].append(row_dict)\n            wh = str(row_dict.get('المخزن', '')).strip()\n            data[\"matches_by_wh\"].setdefault(wh, []).append(row_dict)\n            \n    # 2. Review sheet (يحتاج مراجعة)\n    review_sheet_name = None\n    for name in wb.sheetnames:\n        if \"مراجعة\" in name:\n            review_sheet_name = name\n            break\n            \n    if review_sheet_name:\n        ws = wb[review_sheet_name]\n        headers = [str(cell.value or '').strip() for cell in ws[1]]\n        for row in ws.iter_rows(min_row=2, values_only=True):\n            if not any(row):\n                continue\n            row_dict = {headers[i] if i < len(headers) else f\"col_{i}\": row[i] for i in range(len(row))}\n            data[\"reviews\"].append(row_dict)\n\n    # 3. Not found sheet (لم يتم العثور عليها)\n    nf_sheet_name = None\n    for name in wb.sheetnames:\n        if \"لم يتم\" in name or \"غير متوفر\" in name or \"نواقص\" in name:\n            nf_sheet_name = name\n            break\n            \n    if nf_sheet_name:\n        ws = wb[nf_sheet_name]\n        headers = [str(cell.value or '').strip() for cell in ws[1]]\n        for row in ws.iter_rows(min_row=2, values_only=True):\n            if not any(row):\n                continue\n            row_dict = {headers[i] if i < len(headers) else f\"col_{i}\": row[i] for i in range(len(row))}\n            data[\"not_found\"].append(row_dict)\n            \n    return data\n\ndef main():\n    print(\"Loading Excel workbooks for PROC-012, 014, 015, 016...\")\n    procs = {}\n    for pid, pth in PROCESSES.items():\n        if pth.exists():\n            procs[pid] = load_process_excel(pid, pth)\n            print(f\"Loaded {pid}: {len(procs[pid]['matches'])} matches, {len(procs[pid]['reviews'])} reviews, {len(procs[pid]['not_found'])} not found.\")\n        else:\n            print(f\"Warning: {pid} path {pth} does not exist!\")\n\n    # Summary stats comparison\n    print(\"\\n\" + \"=\"*70)\n    print(\"1. SUMMARY METRICS COMPARISON (المقارنة الرقمية الشاملة)\")\n    print(\"=\"*70)\n    for pid, pdata in procs.items():\n        print(f\"[{pid}]: Total Matches = {len(pdata['matches'])}, Reviews = {len(pdata['reviews'])}, Not Found = {len(pdata['not_found'])}\")\n        for wh, items in pdata['matches_by_wh'].items():\n            print(f\"   -> {wh}: {len(items)} items\")\n\n    # Save loaded summary to json for deeper script inspection\n    output_summary = {\n        pid: {\n            \"matches_count\": len(pdata[\"matches\"]),\n            \"reviews_count\": len(pdata[\"reviews\"]),\n            \"not_found_count\": len(pdata[\"not_found\"]),\n            \"matches\": pdata[\"matches\"],\n            \"reviews\": pdata[\"reviews\"],\n            \"not_found\": pdata[\"not_found\"]\n        }\n        for pid, pdata in procs.items()\n    }\n    with open(r\"C:\\Users\\kakak\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a\\scratch\\extracted_comparison_data.json\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        json.dump(output_summary, f, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2, default=str)\n    print(\"\\nSaved full extracted data to extracted_comparison_data.json.\")\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n","Description":"Extract comparison data from workbooks","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\kakak\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a\\scratch\\comparative_audit.py","toolAction":"Writing script","toolSummary":"Extract comparison data from workbooks"}}]}
